          "id": "C",
          "text": "",
          "html": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "",
          "html": ""
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>19 July 2000 was Wednesday.</p><p>From 19 July 2000 to 17 March 2015, there are 14 years and almost 8 months.</p><p>There are 4 leap years in this period.</p><p>Total extra days = 14 normal years (14 days) + 4 leap years (4 days) = 18 days.</p><p>From 19 July 2014 to 17 March 2015 is 241 days, and 241/7 = 3 days.</p><p>18 plus 3 = 21 days, which is 0, so the day remains Wednesday.</p><p>But since 17 March is before 19 July in 2015, subtract one day:</p><p>Final answer is Tuesday.</p><p>Correct answer is Tuesday.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
