      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>From 29 July 2001 to 29 July 2014: </p><p>10 normal years = 10 × 1 = 10 days </p><p>3 leap years (2004, 2008, 2012) = 3 × 2 = 6 days </p><p>Total shift = 10 + 6 = 16 days</p><p>From 29 July 2014 to 20 February 2015 = 206 days 206 ÷ 7 = 3 days</p><p>Total shift = 16 + 3 = 19 days =&gt; 19 ÷ 7 = 5 days</p><p>Start day = Sunday </p><p>Sunday + 5 days = Friday</p><p>Therefore, the correct answer is Friday.</p>",
